      "reveal": "<span lang=\"de\">-bar</span> ~ \"-able/-ible\" in English. You may be wondering what the difference between <span lang=\"de\">wundervoll</span> and <span lang=\"de\">wunderbar</span> is. It's mainly a matter of mood: <span lang=\"de\">wunderbar</span> is more straightforward, something you might exclaim: <span lang=\"de\">„Wunderbar!“</span>, while <span lang=\"de\">wundervoll</span> is a little more dreamy and poetic."
